      "title": "Controls and Metrics",
      "items": [
        "Concurrency maps to spawned worker tasks.",
        "Runs stop by request count or duration-set atomic flag.",
        "Rate limiting uses interval permits.",
        "hdrhistogram provides percentiles.",
        "Status counts use a sorted BTreeMap."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Trust Boundaries",
      "items": [
        "CLI input, body files, scripts, and target service are outside the process.",
